WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.256
Introducing, the towering point guard from the Midwest, number 32. Earvin “Magic” Johnson.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.340
It’s show time!

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.426
♫

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:11.511
I was assigned to cover Earvin’s first game. 

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:16.266
He did stuff I’ve never seen on a basketball floor before.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:17.809
So the sports writer came in and said,

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:18.935
I want to give you a nickname.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:19.978
How about Magic?

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.147
You're just like, Yeah Right

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.940
My boy’s not going to call me Magic.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.650
Magic.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.235
I learned how to smile because of Magic Johnson.

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:29.696
At Michigan State, it was all

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.990
about Magic this, Magic that.

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:34.534
Just behind his back, no look passes.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.494
If that’s magic then I guess that’s what I am.

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:40.582
The Los Angeles Lakers select Earvin “Magic” Johnson.

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:43.084
All of a sudden we started to win.

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:44.919
He’s going to be the greatest player of all time.

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:53.261
♫

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:55.263
And in walks Magic Johnson approaching the podium.

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:56.514
Let’s go to Magic.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:59.934
First of all, let me say good after late afternoon.

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:08.777
Um, because of the HIV virus that I have attained, uh,

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:12.155
I will have to retire from the Lakers.

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:21.372
Magic becomes a role model for those
who are also afflicted with the disease.

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:26.169
To see somebody who has HIV, on the dream team?

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:28.671
He drove me to be a better basketball player.

00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:30.882
He’s always thinking about the next move.

00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:33.593
This is a movie complex built by Magic Johnson

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.220
in the Crenshaw district of LA.

00:01:35.678 --> 00:01:37.555
It's in the middle of the Bloods and the Crips

00:01:37.555 --> 00:01:39.349
We can't have violence.

00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:42.477
I said call the heads I want to have breakfast.

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:43.561
Ok, you sure?

00:01:43.561 --> 00:01:44.521
And I said "yeah".

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.190
Now he's doing no look passes 

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:49.692
with real estate funds and franchises.

00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:51.361
If you don't make a difference in the black community

00:01:51.361 --> 00:01:53.780
that doesn't matter that you win championships.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.365
He's showing the people how to live a different way.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:58.701
We always said we wanted to have a big family.

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:00.495
In the beginning, he was figuring himself out,

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:01.913
I was figuring myself out.

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:04.833
With EJ, I had to check myself.

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:07.544
You gotta change not him, you.

00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:11.798
Now, I'm in my element.

00:02:12.257 --> 00:02:14.676
I'm going to do me and do my thing.

00:02:16.427 --> 00:02:18.513
I'm just going to be Earvin Johnson.

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:10.523
♫

00:03:18.323 --> 00:03:20.533
I think that you just have
to come out swinging

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:21.659
And I'm swinging.

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:28.833
Magic, Magic
Magic, Magic

